Anyway, um, Will's here on business...

20
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:19,530
...and he didn't have a place to go so I invited him here.

21
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:20,780
Oh, that's nice.

22
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:22,700
Oh, by the way, he's lost a bunch of weight.

23
00:01:22,870 --> 00:01:27,830
I mean, he looks good. Okay, I mean really, really gorgeous.

24
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:35,800
I still love Chandler.

25
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:35,800
Wouldn't hurt you to say it once in a while.

26
