Oh, I wanna get in on this. Hey, Mon?

82
00:04:58,130 --> 00:05:01,590
I don't think I can't help you after all. I didn't realize this game was on.

83
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:05,090
Oh. I didn't know you liked football.

84
00:05:01,840 --> 00:05:05,090
Well, normally, I don't.

85
