But, you know, Green Bay is playing.

86
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:13,180
You like Green Bay?

87
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:13,180
Well, it's only like my favorite bay.

88
00:05:20,610 --> 00:05:22,820
Hey.

89
00:05:20,610 --> 00:05:22,820
Hey.

90
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,860
Happy Thanksgiving.

91
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,860
Aw, thanks.

92
