God, Will, I'm so glad that you came. You just... You look great.

93
00:05:31,330 --> 00:05:32,370
You must've lost like...

94
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,080
A hundred and fifty pounds.

95
00:05:34,250 --> 00:05:37,210
Yeah, I'm gonna be in one of those Subway sandwich commercials.

96
00:05:39,210 --> 00:05:43,590
A pie.

97
00:05:39,210 --> 00:05:43,590
Right. Uh, it's no fat, no sugar, no dairy.

98
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:47,340
It's no good. Throw it out.

99
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:47,340
