This is, uh, my husband, Chandler. Chandler, this is Will.

101
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:54,140
Oh, hey. I'd shake your hand but, uh, I'm really into the game.

102
00:05:55,810 --> 00:05:59,690
Plus, I think it'd be better for my ego if we didn't stand right next to each other.

103
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,110
This is Phoebe.

104
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,110
Hi.

105
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:07,650
Hey. Wow.

106
00:06:10,490 --> 00:06:12,370
Well done.

107
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,580
Wanna give me a hand?

108
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,580
Sure.

109
00:06:14,740 --> 00:06:18,250
Monica, I can't get over how great you look. You look stunning.

110
00:06:18,410 --> 00:06:20,470
You look incredible too. You're just so fit.

111
00:06:20,610 --> 00:06:23,670
I'm watching the game but I'm not deaf.

112
00:06:24,750 --> 00:06:27,010
Oh, um, I meant to tell you, Ross is coming.

113
00:06:27,170 --> 00:06:29,420
Ross is coming. Great, I love Ross.

114
00:06:29,590 --> 00:06:31,180
Well, good. And Rachel Green too.

115
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:34,100
Oh.

116
00:06:35,810 --> 00:06:39,230
Is there a problem?

117
00:06:35,810 --> 00:06:39,230
Nope. Uh, it's okay.

118
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,810
It's just, uh...

119
