God, I hated her.

120
00:06:44,230 --> 00:06:45,770
What?

121
00:06:44,230 --> 00:06:45,770
I hated her.

122
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:48,860
She was horrible to me in high school.

123
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:52,360
