135
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:32,360
Eating chips is like stretching.

136
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:32,360
Okay.

137
00:07:32,570 --> 00:07:33,910
Don't worry, Tribbianis never get full.

138
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,910
I actually know what you're talking about.

139
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,530
And I'm here to tell you something.

140
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:40,660
You can eat and eat and eat, but nothing will ever fill that void.

141
00:07:43,790 --> 00:07:47,380
