142
00:07:43,790 --> 00:07:47,380
This is Will, from high school.

143
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:48,670
Oh, hey.

144
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:48,670
Hello.

145
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,130
Will.

146
00:07:49,840 --> 00:07:51,130
Ross.

147
00:07:51,380 --> 00:07:57,260
Hey, you came. Man, you look incredible. Hot stuff.

148
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:01,600
Hot stuff?

149
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:01,600
