155
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,780
Oh, hey.

156
00:08:15,490 --> 00:08:20,200
Man, I don't think I've seen you since, uh, Lance Davis' graduation party.

157
00:08:20,410 --> 00:08:22,160
That was such a fun night.

158
00:08:20,410 --> 00:08:22,160
Yeah.

159
00:08:22,330 --> 00:08:26,630
Would've been good if we had gotten in, but still, real fun.

160
