God, we were lame back then. Do you remember how into dinosaurs we were?

161
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:37,180
Yeah.

162
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:37,180
So, what do you do now?

163
00:08:39,010 --> 00:08:40,510
