164
00:08:42,770 --> 00:08:46,310
Hi.

165
00:08:42,770 --> 00:08:46,310
Hey, sweetie. Oh, good.

166
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:48,020
Rachel Green.

167
00:08:49,730 --> 00:08:52,480
Oh, oh, that's right. Are you gonna be okay?

168
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:58,200
Oh, I'll be fine. It's just... God, I hate her, Ross. I hate her.

169
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:03,160
Will, high school was a long time ago.

170
00:09:03,370 --> 00:09:06,460
Look at her standing there with those yams.

171
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:12,300
My two greatest enemies, Rachel Green and complex carbohydrates.

172
00:09:13,670 --> 00:09:15,550
Oh, my God, Monica. Who is that?

173
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:22,100
That's Will, from high school.

174
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:22,100
Ah. I do not remember him.

175
00:09:22,350 --> 00:09:26,060
Wow, really got that sexy smoldering thing going on.

176
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:35,690
Oh, my God. Look at the way he's just staring at me.

177
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:38,610
I think he's trying to mouth something to me, but I can't make it out.

178
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:42,530
I hate you.

179
00:09:43,450 --> 00:09:45,950
Okay, dinner's ready.

180
00:09:43,450 --> 00:09:45,950
Okay.

181
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:50,040
Yeah. Solid effort. Solid effort.

182
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:50,040
