187
00:09:55,590 --> 00:09:59,090
But it was a moral victory for the Green Bay Mermen.

188
00:10:03,470 --> 00:10:05,770
Hi. Will, right?

189
00:10:03,470 --> 00:10:05,770
Right.

190
00:10:05,930 --> 00:10:07,680
Right, hi. I'm Rachel Green.

191
00:10:07,890 --> 00:10:12,980
Oh, I remember you.

192
00:10:07,890 --> 00:10:12,980
Really? Aren't you sweet?

193
00:10:13,190 --> 00:10:18,360
I gotta tell you though, I'm having the hardest time placing you.

194
00:10:18,610 --> 00:10:20,990
