195
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:26,700
Did we, um...? Did we fool around at Lance Davis' graduation party?

196
00:10:27,370 --> 00:10:30,670
You are unbelievable.

197
00:10:27,370 --> 00:10:30,670
Thank you.

198
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:35,170
Uh, Rachel? Why don't you sit here? And, Will, you sit way over there.

199
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:46,180
That's it? Even if nobody helps me, I can eat that, no problem.

200
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:47,810
At least give me a challenge.

201
00:10:49,230 --> 00:10:51,520
This is Chandler's chicken.

202
00:10:53,270 --> 00:10:56,400
This is the turkey.

203
00:10:57,400 --> 00:11:00,530
Oh. How big is that?

204
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:05,410
About 19 pounds.

205
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:05,410
It's like me when I was born.

206
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:10,080
All right, who would, uh, like some yams? Will?

207
00:11:10,250 --> 00:11:12,370
Oh, you'd like that, wouldn't you?

208
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,420
What? Oh, you know what? Can we please keep the chicken...

209
00:11:17,590 --> 00:11:19,670
