210
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:23,640
The smell is just... Yuck.

211
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:23,640
Typical. Ahem.

212
00:11:25,470 --> 00:11:27,810
I'm sorry, what?

213
00:11:25,470 --> 00:11:27,810
I said it was typical.

214
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:29,390
Typical of you, Rachel Green.

215
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:33,440
Queen Rachel, does whatever she wants in her little Rachel-land.

216
00:11:38,610 --> 00:11:40,440
Seriously, who is this guy?

217
00:11:40,950 --> 00:11:44,610
Um, ahem, sorry, do you have a problem with me?

218
00:11:44,820 --> 00:11:49,870
I don't know. Do I? Do I?

219
00:11:44,820 --> 00:11:49,870
I think you do.

220
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:54,250
Apparently you were a little mean to him in high school.

221
00:11:54,460 --> 00:11:59,130
A little mean? You made my life miserable.

222
00:11:54,460 --> 00:11:59,130
I had no idea. I'm sorry.

223
00:11:59,340 --> 00:12:03,050
Well, you should be. Screw it. Bring on the yams.

224
00:12:03,470 --> 00:12:05,090
Will, but you've worked so hard.

225
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:07,350
Yams!

226
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:07,350
Okay.

227
00:12:10,430 --> 00:12:13,020
Uh, Will, I just wanna say that I'm real sorry fo...

228
00:12:13,230 --> 00:12:15,020
whatever I did to you in high school.

229
00:12:15,270 --> 00:12:17,270
