235
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:31,660
Me and Ross.

236
00:12:36,170 --> 00:12:39,750
No need to point. She knows who Ross is.

237
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:50,890
So you were in an "I Hate Rachel" club?

238
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:50,890
Yes, he was.

239
00:12:51,060 --> 00:12:52,270
No, no.

240
00:12:54,020 --> 00:12:56,440
So who else was in this club?

241
00:12:56,600 --> 00:13:00,360
Uh, actually, there was also that exchange student from Thailand.

242
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:03,860
But I don't think he knew what it was.

243
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:07,160
So, Ross, we went out for two years and you never told me...

244
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:09,070
...you were in an "I Hate Rachel Club."

245
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:12,790
You went out with her? We had a pact.

246
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:16,540
It was in high school. It's not like it was binding forever.

247
00:13:16,710 --> 00:13:19,250
Then why did it have the word "eternity" in it?

248
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:23,840
Okay, Monica, did you know about this?

249
00:13:24,090 --> 00:13:25,920
I swear I didn't. Hey, is that why you guys...

250
00:13:26,090 --> 00:13:28,260
...used to go up to your bedroom and lock the door?

251
00:13:28,430 --> 00:13:31,970
Yeah.

252
00:13:28,430 --> 00:13:31,970
Huh. A little relieved, I gotta say.

253
00:13:33,810 --> 00:13:38,440
Look, Rach, I'm sorry, okay? I was a stupid kid, okay?

254
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,770
The only reason I joined...

255
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:43,150
Cofounded.

256
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:43,150
Cofounded.

257
00:13:44,690 --> 00:13:48,200
Cofounded the club, was that I was insanely in love with you.

258
00:13:48,410 --> 00:13:50,030
Obviously I didn't handle it very well...

